return {
    ["\n　　我很喜欢您上次寄来的礼物，谢谢您。这架木雕钢琴或许制作粗糙，却正好适合摆在我的书桌上。\n　　听闻您在葬礼后，不眠不休，成功逮捕了凶手，感谢您的付出！毋庸置疑，您是一名优秀的警察，请不要因为旁人的评价与压力改变初心。\n　　随信附上台历回礼，您可以记录重要的事。\n　　祝您工作顺利！永不迟到！"] = "\n	I really like the gift you sent last time, thank you. This wooden carved piano might be crudely made, but it fits perfectly on my desk.\n	I heard that after the funeral, you worked without sleep to successfully arrest the murderer. Thank you for your efforts! There is no doubt that you are an excellent police officer; please do not change your original intention because of others' evaluations and pressure.\n	Attached to this letter is a calendar as a return gift; you can use it to Record important things.\n	I wish you success in your work! May you never be late!",
